OL,3,GNEWSADriver threatened with knife as
OL,4,Abus hijacked and chased in police
OL,5,Apursuit
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has been arrested after a
OL,8,Fhijacked bus was brought to a stop
OL,9,Fafter a police chase.
OL,11,FThe driver of the bus was threatened at
OL,12,Fknife point by a man, who then allowed
OL,13,Fpassengers to leave the bus. However,
OL,14,Fthe bus driver was kept on board.
OL,16,FVideos circulating on social media
OL,17,Fappear to show a Translink Goldliner
OL,18,Fcoach being driven at speed through
OL,19,Fresidential streets while being chased
OL,20,Fby a Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,21,F(PSNI) patrol car.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
